summary: Verify that var and var_qm partitions occupy the expected relative size
description: |
  Builds an AIB image with var and qm_var partitions defined by relative sizes
  and verifies that they occupy the expected fractions of the total image size.

  Test inputs:
    Custom a-i-b manifest, which defines image size using absolute value and partition sizes using relative values
    for the image created in the test.


  Expected results:
    - PASS: "Partition '/var' size 429916160 bytes matches expected 429496729 ± 1%"
    - PASS: "Partition '/var/qm' size 214958080 bytes matches expected 214748364 ± 1%"

  Results location:
    output.txt

require+:
  - bc
duration: 60m
id: 44df142f-ba7b-4965-9ad9-4cdbdf7e11c1
